      342.61,
      539.95,
      389.68
    ],
    "text": "THE following amendments are made to the Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Technological Service published in theGazette Extraordinary No. 1930/12 dated 01.09.2015 as amended by the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1995/10 dated29.11.2016 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and the other matters and conditions set out therein shallremain unchanged.",
