      539.93,
      485.68
    ],
    "text": "Sri Lanka Technological Service as at the effective date of this Service Minute are exempted fromthe requirement of passing the third efficiency bar examination ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      124.65,
      498.61,
      539.92,
      509.68
    ],
    "text": "(II) In addition to the officers in Grade I, the officers who have pass the second efficiency bar",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
